o the museum is the Hall of Commanders, which features a decorative Sword and Shield of Victory and bronze busts of recipients of the Order of Victory, the highest…"],["Triumphal Arch of Moscow","sight",55.73675,37.51992,"Kutuzov Avenue, cca. Ploshchad' Pobedy, 1","","","","","r","The original was built in 1829-34. The current arch was built to Bove's original designs in 1966-68 in the middle of Kutuzov Avenue, close to the Victory Park. An open space surrounding the arch is known as the Victory Square."],["Victory Park","activity",55.73611,37.51667,"","","","","","r","– This massive memorial to WWII was built for the 50-year anniversary of V-E day in 1995. On weekends, it is very popular with newlyweds. There is also a museum to WWII worth visiting if you like military history."]]}